# Rise from the Wreck's targets are all cards "from your graveyard": Bot2's own Pothole Mole milled a Grizzly Bears into Bot2's graveyard,
# and it is refused in the creature slot. Bot1's graveyard holds Llanowar Elves (it has a mana ability, so it is a creature card with
# abilities: refused in the no-abilities slot), Tarmogoyf (its only ability is a static one, a characteristic-defining ability, with no
# keyword and nothing in the ability list: refused too), Grizzly Bears and Memnite. Bot1 takes Bears for the creature slot and for the
# no-abilities slot (one card, returned once); with no Mount or Vehicle card to choose the two other slots ask nothing; Elves and
# Tarmogoyf stay in the graveyard.

